error[E0277]: `Box<u32>` can't be a field of a GC object
 --> tests/ui/native_data_in_a_field.rs:7:12
  |
7 |     value: Box<u32>,
  |            ^^^ not a `Member`, plain data, an `External` or a `LocalExternal`
  |
  = help: the trait `HeapData` is not implemented for `Box<u32>`
  = note: native data (a `Box`, a `Vec`, an `Arc`, a reference) goes in an `External` if it is `Send`, else in a `LocalExternal`
  = help: the following other types implement trait `HeapData`:
            ()
            Cell<T>
            Option<T>
            PhantomData<T>
            RefCell<T>
            [T; N]
            bool
            char
          and $N others
  = note: required for `Box<u32>` to implement `HeapField`

